{"title": "Omentum transposition for treatment of Alzheimer disease in China 题录", "authors": "Goldsmith Harry S.1,2 ; 1.University of California, Davis, USA ; 2.Neurological Surgery, P.O. Box, Glenbrook, NV, USA", "orgs": "", "source": "中华神经外科杂志（英文）", "year": "2016", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "Omentum ; Alzheimer’s disease ; Deteriorating neurons", "abstract": "Background: A paper was published in a Chinese medical journal that suggested that the placing of an intact vascularized omental pedicle would increase cerebral blood flow and could decelerate the development of Alzheimer’s disease. However, the paper showed limited support for the operation. The purpose of this paper is to suggest that the lack of enthusiasm for the operation may deserve re-evaluation.Method: The operation that was evaluated required an intact omental pedicle to be placed direc...", "doi": "", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R-33", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=4Kwr3-EHKF4Wx-5R9fswkrKbOQXyVC0D9QO0qIuyUbClTDrH4u8WHRVqrw3h3FJAC9OgBFVpQGJOp8ML30UBHWhkkWaTCJrD773rcunvYUzF47t0C4StDHmw6HSg9TY7ZNMHAJWyYU02WjoiM4GbNzMd6W99qFp277FpslqhiuPQhXvjAkRV9g==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "05678da0e2e4"}
{"title": "医学名词应注意规范使用 题录", "authors": "李慧", "orgs": "", "source": "中华医学杂志", "year": "2016", "volume": "", "issue": "", "pages": "", "keywords": "", "abstract": "<正>医学名词不规范、不统一, 直接关系到医学科技的准确表达、采集、使用、传递和医保工作。规范、统一的医学科学技术名词, 是医学科技期刊等信息交流的基础。为此, 作者将日常工作及期刊中见到的不规范和错误使用医学名词进行了梳理, 希望引起读者的广泛注意。一、实例分析信息技术的飞速发展, 使医学信息资源的共享更为便捷。但医学名词使用不规范、不统一, 直接关系到诊疗的准确表达, 影响其在不同医院、不同部门的交", "doi": "", "cited_count": "", "download_count": "", "fund": "", "classification": "", "clc_code": "R-33", "url": "https://kns.cnki.net/kcms2/article/abstract?v=4Kwr3-EHKF4Wx-5R9fswkrKbOQXyVC0D9QO0qIuyUbDp8kn7bYtvO00vm1jSBPpLB1o2pwBAZwHAWwXWa71_eCSjCKdQKyaAOWM0G11o7HqWhNg7cvf6gJcUHCjjb432V_73TwTofWafz3blK5hxTn5eRg65RbVV0rrPFCB13E71I4BlgPKlcw==&uniplatform=NZKPT&language=CHS", "uid": "d4b36527700e"}
